      "arguments": {
        "content": "# Product comparison\n\n## Summary table\n\n| Product | Price | Project limit | Retention | Export |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---|\n| Atlas | 120 USD | 40 projects | 7 days | CSV |\n| Birch | 180 USD | 75 projects | 14 days | JSON |\n| Cedar | 240 USD | 90 projects | 30 days | XML |\n\n## Citations\n\n- Atlas: Price 120 USD; limit 40 projects; retention 7 days; export CSV. [Source](http://127.0.0.1:53188/atlas)\n- Birch: Price 180 USD; limit 75 projects; retention 14 days; export JSON. [Source](http://127.0.0.1:53188/birch)\n- Cedar: Price 240 USD; limit 90 projects; retention 30 days; export XML. [Source](http://127.0.0.1:53188/cedar)\n\n## Recommendation\n\n**Best overall value: Birch.** It is cheaper than Cedar while offering a much higher project limit than Atlas and twice the retention of Atlas. If you need the lowest price, choose Atlas. If you need the highest project limit or longest retention, choose Cedar.\n",
